  "description": "After years of devotion, Si-Woo’s boyfriend betrays him; then, the company he worked so hard at goes under. Feeling totally defeated, Si-Woo escapes into a game world just to take a break from reality. There, he meets a newbie named Woo-Jin, whose kind advice and hard-working attitude inspire Si-Woo to move on from his past and start living with purpose again. Determined never to fall for someone who’ll hurt him again, Si-Woo makes a vow to his friend: No love, no dating. Ever again! But when he meets his new boss, Si-Woo’s willpower will be put to the ultimate test…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
